<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-15T20:27:08.435Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 20:27:08 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Boko Haram and ISWAP continue striking Borno military bases, killing soldiers, while bandits and Islamist fighters killed a traditional ruler in Plateau and abducted a couple and child in Kaduna. A Nigerian police officer publicly questioned a driver about a demanded name tag and ID, and a US Supreme Court is reviewing the asylum case of a Nigerian who allegedly cooked for unknown gunmen. The NIS pledged justice after an officer was killed in a Niger attack. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiigFBVV95cUxPcFZtNFNEN2JfMWRJaVE3RTFYY21mdlFtYmNSM2pWRkdpRU5COVZ0Q2lFT3ZHUXRQd2tYU2o2b0VYMjFiRXBtZWhiU2cyZThLQ0kzVW1DNHFoNWlLNkZFMEs1TzVaQ1hfLUFJMENBa3VvVmxDTzZxSFA2QmhSV24weVZYWDhSQnc1Tmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE40VXR3b29ES0xETXpOSzBiUDBRNG5BNkJGMnd2MlZFeDRDNENNaHdyRkU4ZVlmS3FxM1YzcHVJSGdCQ1Q1NEh6cm1KR19OSWc0ZGg0UkFHRUw0V1A0QjRYRG1iOW5hZy13UGg1SXpZSlFZbnU3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Trust&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxQSGw3WXdtajhyMzhvSHMycE1LZGFnaFRoYWZnM3JHZFBGeEhJcDlkeUpQb2luaWxOcklNRHROSFpXcUVJNGR3cmxsZ0xSRk9VZjQ5OE4wOU9ScEVuNEgwYVVPY1p0UkVzS3pTNVlULUZuMjdiSjVBbFhKN2FrXzFFdDhBMnl6cFN6Zjhvd3UySy02bi1OTDZrN0hldTBBczlUeWNpb0JNWThqclZtT1lYaTdESFV4Qlk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPNXNLem13U2xWSWl5WEUwQjItdHFLSWlZclVkY25ubEFqQlhxSG40dWs1d1BjVlJrRU91aXZrR0ZfSm5LbDZzX1BMUWtzMWhWazkxZVV0UjVPbi1qamVhcXBOeWo3aEI5RlBFTzJ4ZThWU0JPZDZHc1BZTkdoNEcxZWo2UUV3WmpPUGdIdVVHa2JFUmRxUm9VMGJDRk8?oc=5&quot;&gt;TVC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQMnFsVTVNWEF1MWFiMHdaWm1kZ